","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends or is cancelled, its wait ends at once and the subject stays pending for its other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"awaiters. A subject sent an error ends the batched sequence with that error, except"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"CancellationError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (as when another awaiter cancels the subject): then the signal stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"firing and the batches go on. A subject sent a value before iteration begins fires when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signal’s task starts, which may come after elements have arrived, so the first batch may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"short. Each batched sequence iterated with this strategy listens anew, so a subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already sent a value fires again when a later batched sequence’s signal task starts."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let shutdown = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","for try await messages in inbox.batch(strategy: .either(.count(50), .signal(shutdown))) {","    store(messages)","}","\/\/ Elsewhere: flush whatever is pending before shutting down.","try shutdown.send()"]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/batchstrategy\/signal(_:)-88w9i"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/signal(_:)-88w9i","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Flushes once, when the given subject is sent a value."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"Afluent","roleHeading":"Type Method","symbolKind":"method",